# Rust build artifacts
target/
**/target/

# The .so files native/build.{ps1,sh} copies into app/src/main/jniLibs/ are
# ignored by the ROOT .gitignore (`app/src/main/jniLibs/*/*.so`) — a rooted
# pattern here would resolve to native/app/..., which does not exist.

# cargo-ndk leaves these behind
**/*.rs.bk
Cargo.lock.bak
